<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces and their Russian allies are carrying out indiscriminate drone strikes that have killed 94 civilians, while the Malian army and rebel groups continue to abuse civilians. In Nigeria, gunmen attacked a convoy in Borno, killing 15 soldiers and task force members, and terrorists killed soldiers at a Borno military post. Bandits raided two communities in Niger, causing scores of deaths. Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso have resumed talks with ECOWAS after a withdrawal, indicating diplomatic engagement alongside the violence. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPTXZOZlFXZVZMeFpHRTNuRUw1b2pzaDVXT1gzdzJBdzJVVF9KMk9ZTWpPeVhKbC1RVy00TTR2eFVzbmJwVFAwc1V5cjZ1SFhOOUc5TVBxcFk0TjJzck1pcFBseGxObzF2Zml4Y1NHZGtSQ29SOHp4TTFzNm50REVmYVRSLW13SklfNjlfQXhrZ0J1RGZQR19YR0ZiMFo0azMz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQekJZS0Nab2NieDNYRjhYdU1xQXduZ1pwUGREVjdKZl96eWV1TGdrSEJPOUJVODlZdnpmVUJ4eVNFZXpxZk5zY1dESlUxWDVZSnNueXVsTVFRY0V0djFRSEtibDMyOURzT3FUaFV6ekUzejVuQVJMR2VlRGh2THZWUUI5cEtvdnZUYzg0Qm8ycUctMGVHVWo1QnRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQMXkzU2g3bTNCbGNDLURGcUR6OEtDcU8tbUhGZzlIMnNVLUlERWEzWURLV3hoMWpiNjFOalgyQ1pWcGJJdmtNbGxHOGgtcTFCS3hIeFpmWTZ1bmV2alR5YWxvV2VtcURFWXM4bzVtNktocjFSaE1oTGM2SU9Salc2QTd6NWpCZ3JTeEFxb0JzU1VOYjlVbXc2QV96ZmlvOWdnSWFBMWVfaFpVem8?oc=5&quot;&gt;globalpost.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9DZlVXRTNQaE8xYk84VGRFLVAybmpaSV91LS0xUGtyb29VRTZmdV9oRHNyN1BCU2pGNzlNenhyRUFTUE1PNF9COXJqN1YzLVBPZlFiUFJ6MVhrZU5vSXQ5M19sRDh4a